{
  "label": "beachvacation11",
  "title_zh": "",
  "lines": [
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "label beachvacation11:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya1.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, well, well! Glad you decided to join us, Sir!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. Very glad. Hooray.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I find Molly and Maya hiding from the sun under a slew of parasols on my way down the beach.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": When you said you were bringing multiple umbrellas, I didn’t really believe you.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya2",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya2.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya2"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, you should have! Without constant protection from the sun, I’m as good as dead.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t know how you Japanese people handle these harsh Summers so well. I feel like I’m being tossed into the depths of Orodruin every time I step outside.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have no idea what that is.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Then you have much to learn! Perhaps the two of us should retreat back to the inn and have ourselves a Lord of the Rings marathon? Aye, Supreme Overlord?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re just trying to escape from the outdoors again, aren’t you?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya3.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Guh...I had no idea you could read minds as well...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This is concerning for a number of reasons.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That aside...how are you, Maya? I didn’t really see you at all yesterday once we got to the beach.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Correct. I was beginning to think my plan of avoiding you was going to keep up for the full 48 hours.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I regret to see that this is very much not the case.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Thanks. I missed you too.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please go away.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya4",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya4.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya4"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Are you two like arch nemeses or something? I haven’t really been around long but every interaction you’ve had together since I joined the class has been pretty toxic.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Even thought about reporting you to the GMs on one or more occasions for gameplay sabotage.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This isn’t a game. This is real life.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya5",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya5.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya5"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What do you know, Maya?!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": A little too much, I’m afraid.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, it’s a game to me. And it’s a game to the Supreme Overlord as well.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t even know what we’re talking about right now.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya6",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya6.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya6"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Strange. It appears as if we might actually be on the same page for once.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Though, I suppose that makes sense given that Molly is perhaps the only person I know who is more delusional than you.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya1",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya1.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya1"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Did ya hear that, Sir? We’re brothers in arms. Fellow degenerates.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Who cares if the world doesn’t understand how you and I look at it? As long as we’re leveling up our stats with everybody, I’m sure we’ll survive.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Molly, why did you come here again? You’re really not suited for the outdoor world.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya7",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya7.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya7"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Well, it was to play D&D. But now that that’s over I’m kinda just floatin’ out in the Twisting Nether until the next time we all meet up.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh, are you guys not playing again tonight?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": We are not.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Ayane’s character died so she needs time to prepare a new one.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": There’s the issue with Futaba as well.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She wasn’t able to play last night and I heard that she went back to the dorm this morning.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait, really? How come?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She said she wasn’t feeling well.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I imagine it’s because of the heat.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It won’t be an issue soon, though.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya8",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya8.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya8"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That’s right, Sir. Winter is coming.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why did you say that so menacingly?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya9",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya9.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya9"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh my God! You really don’t know anything, do you? What do you even do for fun?!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": He peeks on [young_girls] while they’re getting changed.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I mean, so do I, but it’s normally in the form of a game. You know there are much easier ways to do that, don’t you?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oh please. As if anyone would be attracted to girls in a video game. That just doesn’t even make sense.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya3",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya3.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya3"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m just going to pretend I didn’t hear that...You two carry on with your normie conversation while I lay here and innervate myself.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Try to do things like that in private, Molly.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya10",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya10.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya10"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It‘s a spell to restore my mana and it’s very wholesome!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I might be a degenerate but even I wouldn’t stoop to doing that surrounded by a crowd of my friends!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": My lust level is nowhere near high enough!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya13.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Now if you’ll excuse me-",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Bzzzzzzzzzzz...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is she doing?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Innervating.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Does she really need to make those noises, though?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Does she really need to do 90%% of the things that she does?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Good point.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I take a few steps toward the towel the two of them are sitting on and begin to crouch down.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Can I take a seat? I’m getting a little tired of-",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya11",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya11.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya11"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": No thank you.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": But there’s plenty of room.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I said no thank you.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’m afraid you might accidentally touch me.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Would that really be so bad?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya12",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya12.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya12"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I fear that my skin would melt off if you even thought about touching me.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Your skin would have probably melted off by now because it’s pretty unfeasible to think that I haven’t imagined touching you at some point.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya13",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya13.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya13"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re disgusting.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How many times is that now? Four? Five?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Not enough to get the point across, apparently.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why are you even here?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And where is Ami?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": She seemed to take her time waking you up this morning, so I can only imagine what that must mean.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "if amilust10 == True:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Wait...",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Does Maya know about that?",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "I know her and Ami are best friends, but I didn’t think she’d go as far as telling her friend that she’s engaged in [incest] with her [uncle].",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "That just seems like a horrible idea in every sense of the word.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "But...then again...Maya has been known to understand a little more than she’s supposed to at times.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "This is incredibly worrying.",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have no idea what you’re talking about.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Apologies. Of course you don’t.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "else:",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I have no idea what you’re talking about. All she did was wake me up and walk down here with me.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Really.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Interesting.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya14",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya14.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya14"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Oooookay. I’m tired of not being involved anymore. Molly MacCormack has joined the battle.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Welcome back Molly. How was your intervention?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Innervation, Sir. You need to memorize your spells or you’ll never make it into the raid group.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that a thing I even want to be a part of?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya16",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya16.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya16"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Of course! It’s only the peak of the endgame experience!",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": The only thing better than getting a well-rounded raid group is checking the tags and not seeing anything about vore.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": How do you know all of these strange words?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Am I really getting that old?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya17",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya17.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya17"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Yes. I’ve been telling you that since you first showed up at the shrine.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re disturbingly old. So much so that I don’t understand how you haven’t been arrested for hanging around us in public yet.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wow, you’re really firing on all cylinders today. Aren’t you, Maya?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re ruining my vacation.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": All you’re doing is sitting on a towel. That’s not really high quality vacation material.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": And sleeping until almost noon and having your [niece] come to wake you up is?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya18",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya18.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya18"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That doesn’t sound all that bad to me. I’m sure I’ve even read through a few pretty...interesting scenes that have started that way.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do girls like you exist?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya19",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya19.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya19"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why do any of us exist, Maya?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What is life if not an excuse to feel pain? To grow old and die.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It’s how the universe was designed. We’re all creatures just struggling to find our purpose before our time runs out.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": ...",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Is that supposed to be me?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It was pretty spot on, to tell you the truth.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It was not. She didn’t even get my face right.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya20",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya20.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya20"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Please leave me alone, Sensei. I can not enjoy my vacation with you standing so close to me.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Make yourself useful and fetch me a drink before I fade away into nothingness.",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya21",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya21.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya21"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": This isn’t funny.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Like my Maya impression, Sensei? It’s pretty good, right?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That was my first time tryin’ the whole ‘expressionless’ face thing. Did it look okay?",
      "spk": "Molly",
      "spkColor": "#4FCB80",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": It was perfect. I actually thought you were Maya for a second.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "scene mollymaya22",
      "cap": true,
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya22.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya22"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": You’re not funny either.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": That impression was nothing like me.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Why don’t you give us your best Molly impression then, Maya?",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I’d rather die.",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Urrheak here is just jealous that my personality can’t be so easily mimicked.",
