      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": I don’t hear anything at all.",
      "spk": "Sensei",
      "spkColor": "#969696",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": In fact, have you seen Maya around? I’m starting to worry that she might have gotten lost or something.",
