      "img": "游戏图片/Events/mollymaya26.webp",
      "alt": "mollymaya26"
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Wait...",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": What are they doing over there?",
      "spk": "Maya",
      "spkColor": "#20EF00",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ""
    },
    {
      "en": "Something off in the distance catches Maya’s attention.",
