      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Okay but...I don’t really know how hard to swing the bat...",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Don’t we have anything a little less...well, hard?",
      "spk": "Karin",
      "spkColor": "#AC9D77",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": If it ain’t hard there’s no way you’ll kill the melon!",
