      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
    },
    {
      "en": ": Just give it a good ole whack and show it that you’re co-captain of the soccer team for a reason!",
      "spk": "Miku",
      "spkColor": "#FF8112",
      "zh": ""
